{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/473078-taking-liguistic-genius-twice","id":473078,"title":"Taking \"Liguistic Genius\" Twice.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-08T11:20:14-07:00","id":473078,"title":"Taking \"Liguistic Genius\" Twice.","content":"Would taking the LIGUISTIC GENIUS extra twice mean getting eight times as many language families per point of Liguistics? would taking the LINGISTIC GENIUS extra twice and five dots in Liguistics be the same as knowing all human languages?<br /> <br /> Thank-you for your attention and help.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T11:47:11-07:00","id":473108,"title":"","content":"Knowing <i>all</i> human languages is only possible with the broadest familial languages (Indo-European), even then the language isolates (Korean) and minor families of major setting influence (Japonic) will be able to swallow up a good number of stacking purchases to reach that goal.<br /> By narrowing the acceptable relations to less general levels (Germanic &amp; Sino-Tibetan or even Western Germanic &amp; Mandarin), the number of times the enhancement must be bought increases. Knowing all human languages is probably cheaper achieved with some kind of mind-to-mind speech.<br /> -I- might increase the multiplier by one each additional purchase (x5 for two, x6 for three, etc).<br /> -shrug-","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4458,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","user":"Nihilist","date":".  Formatting 04-08-2015, 03:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T06:03:45-07:00","id":475677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nihilist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/473078-taking-liguistic-genius-twice?p=473108#post473108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Knowing <i>all</i> human languages is only possible with the broadest familial languages (Indo-European), even then the language isolates (Korean) and minor families of major setting influence (Japonic) will be able to swallow up a good number of stacking purchases to reach that goal.<br /> By narrowing the acceptable relations to less general levels (Germanic &amp; Sino-Tibetan or even Western Germanic &amp; Mandarin), the number of times the enhancement must be bought increases. Knowing all human languages is probably cheaper achieved with some kind of mind-to-mind speech.<br /> -I- might increase the multiplier by one each additional purchase (x5 for two, x6 for three, etc).<br /> -shrug-</div> </div> </div> </div>So you think that Linguistic Genius can be taken multiple times? Does that add to the numbers of slots or multiply them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T07:41:57-07:00","id":476939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/473078-taking-liguistic-genius-twice?p=475677#post475677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So you think that Linguistic Genius can be taken multiple times?</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't matter what i think, but for conversation; yeah sure, why not. I allowed Quickness to be purchased multiple times - i can't see how any other enhancement could compete with that level of systemic-meltdown.<br /> -blush-<br /> Whether it should be allowed to be bought multiple times in anyone else's game is a different conversation entirely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/473078-taking-liguistic-genius-twice?p=475677#post475677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Does that add to the numbers of slots or multiply them?</div> </div> </div> </div>You actually quoted my answer above.<br /> -tease-<br /> But to reiterate and (hopefully) clarify; the <i>multiplier</i> for Linguistic Genius is the number by which you multiply your Linguistics ability to figure maximum language families. When you first buy the enhancement the <i>multiplier</i> is four (x4) - so a character with three dots of Linguistics is going to have access to twelve (3x4=12) language families, with five dots they will have twenty (5x4=20). Raising the <i>multiplier</i> by more than one for any additional purchases quickly drives the enhancement into difficult to handle numbers (3x12=36) requiring more fractitious division of language families to even feed the character's growing collection.<br /> Since it's cheaper to buy Linguistics than Enhancements all the characters who take the enhancement multiple times are likely to have their linguistics at least midway and often higher. Leading an eventual break-down between numbers and available Language families, when defined widely enough. So i might rule that additional purchases raise the <i>multiplier</i> by one (x4 to x5 then x6, etc..), not by another four (x4 to x8 then x12), we won't be multiplying any <i>multipliers</i> in my already overly-generous interpretation.<br /> Make sense?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4458-nihilist","name":"Nihilist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4458_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T11:38:56-07:00","id":478147,"title":"","content":"It makes sense. Especially as a multiplier of five is still a pretty good deal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T11:51:18-07:00","id":479320,"title":"","content":"i dont see any reason why not, although i would limit the number of times you could take it to your mega-int level, which itself is limited to quantum+1.<br /> <br /> the old linguistic rules can be a bit confining for some concepts, but speaking an even larger set of languages isnt really unbalancing when you already invested in it enough to know several. i would make the new levels additive, so you add that value to the multiplier for each level.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4695-teulisch","name":"Teulisch","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}